@startuml
!include common-style.puml

title Sequence: Complete Examination\nDoctor finalizes the examination

actor Doctor
participant "Exam Page\n(Frontend)" as FE
participant "ExaminationsController" as EC
participant "ExaminationsService" as ES
database "PostgreSQL" as DB

Doctor -> FE : Click "Complete Examination"
FE -> EC : POST /api/v1/examinations/{id}/complete
activate EC

EC -> ES : completeExamination(id)
activate ES

ES -> DB : SELECT Examination + Visit
DB --> ES : Examination + Visit data

alt Examination not IN_PROGRESS
  ES --> EC : BadRequestException\n"Exam is not in IN_PROGRESS status"
  EC --> FE : 400 Bad Request
  FE --> Doctor : Show error
else Valid IN_PROGRESS exam
  ES -> DB : $transaction:\n  UPDATE Examination { status: DONE }\n  UPDATE Visit { status: DONE }
  DB --> ES : committed
  ES --> EC : completed ExaminationDTO
  EC --> FE : 200 OK
  FE --> Doctor : Show read-only completed exam
end

deactivate ES
deactivate EC

note over ES
After completion:
- Examination becomes read-only (no PATCH allowed).
- Visit status = DONE enables invoice creation.
- State: Visit IN_EXAM -> DONE.
- State: Examination IN_PROGRESS -> DONE.
end note

@enduml
